,"verses":[{"k":"36:71","t":"Do they not see that We have created for them from what Our hands have made, grazing livestock, and [then] they are their owners?","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":71,"sd":null},{"k":"36:72","t":"And We have tamed them for them, so some of them they ride, and some of them they eat.","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":72,"sd":null},{"k":"36:73","t":"And for them therein are [other] benefits and drinks, so will they not be grateful?","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":73,"sd":null},{"k":"36:74","t":"But they have taken besides Allāh [false] deities that perhaps they would be helped.","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":74,"sd":null},{"k":"36:75","t":"They are not able to help them, and they [themselves] are for them soldiers in attendance.","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":75,"sd":null},{"k":"36:76","t":"So let not their speech grieve you. Indeed, We know what they conceal and what they declare.","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":76,"sd":null},{"k":"36:77","t":"Does man not consider that We created him from a [mere] sperm-drop - then at once he is a clear adversary?","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":77,"sd":null},{"k":"36:78","t":"And he presents for Us an example and forgets his [own] creation. He says, \"Who will give life to bones while they are disintegrated?\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":78,"sd":null},{"k":"36:79","t":"Say, \"He will give them life who produced them the first time; and He is, of all creation, Knowing.\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":79,"sd":null},{"k":"36:80","t":"[It is] He who made for you from the green tree, fire, and then from it you ignite.","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":80,"sd":null},{"k":"36:81","t":"Is not He who created the heavens and the earth Able to create the likes of them? Yes, [it is so]; and He is the Knowing Creator.","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":81,"sd":null},{"k":"36:82","t":"His command is only when He intends a thing that He says to it, \"Be,\" and it is.","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":82,"sd":null},{"k":"36:83","t":"So exalted is He in whose hand is the realm of all things, and to Him you will be returned.","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":83,"sd":null}],"juz":23,"hizb":45,"surahs":[36],"sajdah":false}